      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prospect_Heights%2C_Brooklyn",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Barclays Center opened in 2012 on the neighborhood’s northwest edge, sparking debate over its scale and economic impact.",
